---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Toolkit sales paused | Nomad Matrix">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Toolkit sales paused</h1>
    <p>Review date: November 14, 2026. We have stopped new sales of the Pro Relocation &amp; Tax Kit.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What we found</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
      <li>The travel worksheet totals trips across countries instead of filtering the selected country. Its remaining-days formula subtracts from a text label.</li>
      <li>The budget sheet uses a visa income threshold in place of the user's actual income.</li>
      <li>Day counts alone cannot establish tax residency or compliance. The workbook's compliance labels should not be relied on.</li>
      <li>The general English document examples are not a verified country-specific application kit. Advertised multi-country checklists were not delivered.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Existing purchasers</h2>
    <p>The Gumroad products have been unpublished rather than deleted. Keep your receipt and use its download or support link for your purchase. We have not replaced the files silently. Do not rely on the spreadsheet's tax, compliance or savings outputs.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Before sales can resume</h2>
    <p>We need a narrower product scope, corrected calculations with boundary tests, traceable sources, appropriate professional review of consequential legal or tax content, and observed completion of the advertised task by representative users. No reopening date is promised.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
